MMRM分析。安全性分析以SS为基础，描述性统计TEAE/SAE发生率、生命体征、实验室检查及12导联ECG。本研究不设置期中分析、样本量再估计、SRC或DMC。","rationale":"项目已确认：（1）疗效假设依据为同类外周限制性κ阿片受体激动剂透析人群III期（静脉剂型）已发表阳性结果；（2）样本量为II期剂量探索精度考量每组40例；（3）主要终点为第8周WI-NRS周平均下降≥4分应答率；（4）估计目标策略treatment policy、FAS、NRI主分析加tipping point敏感性、连续次要终点MMRM；（5）无期中分析/样本量再估计/SRC/DMC。医学经理需确认：（1）同类III期阳性结果的具体文献引用及与KRX-203口服剂型的桥接论证；（2）每组40例的精度计算假设（预期应答率、检验水准、把握度）；（3）MMRM协变量设定；（4）tipping point参数范围；（5）TEAE采集窗口及安全性评估截止时点。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、估计目标、期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_ebeae07da861983b","section_number":"9.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:5bbf1a306475b57508128689","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:40a436d9255d20","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c0e10622ed24c4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"f61562ef7ad72d4de1c92de2399e1eba347f08bfdf0a15a814d600639f26b8b2","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_6d9208d7233030ca:full-draft:5bbf1a306475b57508128689","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:5bbf1a306475b57508128689","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:2b84d56f7381ab57badd218418ca3197033eba48f09fde31a83dc955f19a788a:5bbf1a306475b57508128689","text_sha256":"f61562ef7ad72d4de1c92de2399e1eba347f08bfdf0a15a814d600639f26b8b2"},{"content_sha256":"56487773107202eb3a0cf101470d671f4797ddb0efe1253b921498f1e0118a89","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d41